<title>UK: Deutsche Ausgleichsbank sets $300 mln 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Ausgleichsbank sets $300 mln 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE AUSGLEICHSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    18.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    18.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-250  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND WHEN-ISSUED FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
